<h2 style="font-size: 28px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Examination Overview – NISM Series IV: Interest Rate Derivatives Certification</h2>
 <br />
										
                                        <div class="mb-2" style="color: #000;">
 <p style="color: #000;"><br />
    The exam builds a foundational understanding for professionals in the interest rate derivatives segment. It ensures clarity on fixed-income markets, derivative products, regulatory aspects, and the operational framework of clearing and settlement.
  </p>
  <p style="color: #000;">
    The exam also equips candidates with the skills required to participate in India’s interest rate derivatives market — including bond futures, options, trading strategies, and compliance with governing regulations.
  </p>

  <h3 style="font-size: 22px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Examination Objectives</h3>
  <p style="color: #000;"><br />
    After completing the exam, candidates will be able to:
  </p>
  <ul style="color: #000;">
    <p style="color: #000;"><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Understand fixed-income and interest rate derivatives markets.</p>
    <p style="color: #000;"><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Apply strategies for bond futures and interest rate risk management.</p>
    <p style="color: #000;"><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Comprehend clearing, settlement, and risk control processes.</p>
    <p style="color: #000;"><img src="images/BULLET.png" alt="" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 8px;" />Familiarize with the Indian regulatory framework.</p>

<div style="border: 1px solid #90caf9; background-color: #e3f2fd; padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 5px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <p style="color: #000; font-size: 14px; margin: 0;">
    For more details, please visit the official website of 
    <a href="https://www.nism.ac.in/" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #0000f8;"><strong>NISM</strong></a>.
  </p>
</div>

<h3 style="font-size: 22px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Assessment Structure</h3>
  <p style="color: #000;"><br />
    The NISM-Series IV: Interest Rate Derivatives Certification Exam is structured as follows:
  </p><br />

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid #90CAF9;">
    <thead style="background-color: #e3f2fd;">
      <tr>
        <th style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #90CAF9; text-align: left;">Component</th>
        <th style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #90CAF9; text-align: left;">Details</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody style="color: #000;">
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Examination Type</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Multiple Choice Questions (MCQs)</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Number of Questions</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">100</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Maximum Marks</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">100</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Passing Score</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">60%</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Negative Marking</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">25% per incorrect answer</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Exam Duration</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">2 hours</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Language</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">English</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Mode</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Online (Computer-Based)</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Certificate Validity</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">3 Years</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">Test Centers</td><td style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #bbdefb;">PAN India</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>   
  <h3 style="font-size: 22px; color: #1565c0; margin-top: 30px;">Syllabus Outline with Weightages</h3><br />
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <thead style="background-color: #e3f2fd;">
      <tr>
        <th style="border: 1px solid #90CAF9; padding: 8px;">Unit No.</th>
        <th style="border: 1px solid #90CAF9; padding: 8px;">Unit Name</th>
        <th style="border: 1px solid #90CAF9; padding: 8px;">Weightage (%)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
